      "name": "Lunging Bite",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The nodocite hunter Strides up to its Speed then makes a jaws Strike. If it moved at least 15 feet with Lunging Bite, the target is Off-Guard against this Strike.</p>",
