    {
      "name": "Target Lock",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The nodocite hunter's last action was a successful jaws Strike</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The nodocite hunter assesses the biometrics and genetic material of the creature it bit, storing this genetic material in an internal cavity and locking onto the associated target's DNA. The nodocite hunter gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks to Seek the target and Survival checks to Track the target for 24 hours or until the nodocite hunter locks onto another target, whichever is first.</p>",
